From: CanMehEvolve <noreply@example.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] CRC::Get16: model rewrite accepted by the search (generation
 14)

Provenance: greedy search, seed 4, generation 14, region 26 (CRC::Get16).
Generated by the model (deepseek-v4.1-flash); not hand-written. Search-time ratio R (candidate/stock, <1 is faster): 0.8506 -> 0.8494 at acceptance (max of two measurements). This is a ranking value, NOT an independent per-patch
confirmation; only the fixed FINAL patch of the run was re-measured independently.
Cumulative patch it was derived from: runs/deepseek/greedy-s4-1072871/patches/gen_14.patch (diff against stock; do not apply together with the others).
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/fit_crc.cpp | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/fit_crc.cpp b/src/fit_crc.cpp
index b46aff2..b8bfe0f 100644
--- a/src/fit_crc.cpp
+++ b/src/fit_crc.cpp
@@ -17,7 +17,7 @@ namespace fit
 
 FIT_UINT16 CRC::Get16(FIT_UINT16 crc, FIT_UINT8 byte)
 {
-   static constexpr FIT_UINT16 crc_table[256] =
+   alignas(64) static constexpr FIT_UINT16 crc_table[256] =
    {
       0x0000, 0xC0C1, 0xC181, 0x0140, 0xC301, 0x03C0, 0x0280, 0xC241,
       0xC601, 0x06C0, 0x0780, 0xC741, 0x0500, 0xC5C1, 0xC481, 0x0440,
@@ -53,7 +53,8 @@ FIT_UINT16 CRC::Get16(FIT_UINT16 crc, FIT_UINT8 byte)
       0x8201, 0x42C0, 0x4380, 0x8341, 0x4100, 0x81C1, 0x8081, 0x4040
    };
 
-   return static_cast<FIT_UINT16>((crc >> 8) ^ crc_table[(crc ^ byte) & 0xFF]);
+   const FIT_UINT8 index = static_cast<FIT_UINT8>(crc) ^ byte;
+   return static_cast<FIT_UINT16>((crc >> 8) ^ crc_table[index]);
 }
 
 FIT_UINT16 CRC::Calc16(const volatile void *data, FIT_UINT32 size)
